       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. ENTRADA.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WRK-INFRA               PIC X(08) VALUE 'INFRA01'.
       01  WRK-NEGOCIO             PIC X(08) VALUE 'NEGOCIO1'.
       LINKAGE SECTION.
       01  DFHCOMMAREA.
           COPY COMAREA.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-PRINCIPAL SECTION.
           IF EIBCALEN EQUAL ZEROS
              MOVE 99 TO RETORNO
              EXEC CICS RETURN END-EXEC
           END-IF
           EXEC CICS LINK PROGRAM(WRK-INFRA) COMMAREA(DFHCOMMAREA)
                END-EXEC
           EVALUATE TRUE
              WHEN OPC-CONSULTA
              WHEN OPC-LISTA
                   PERFORM 2000-CONSULTAR
              WHEN OPC-INCLUIR
                   MOVE 12 TO RETORNO
              WHEN OTHER
                   MOVE 08 TO RETORNO
           END-EVALUATE
           EXEC CICS RETURN END-EXEC.
       2000-CONSULTAR SECTION.
           EXEC CICS LINK PROGRAM(WRK-NEGOCIO) COMMAREA(DFHCOMMAREA)
                END-EXEC.
       2000-99-FIM. EXIT.
